VOICE
- Kokoro-82M (hexgrad), voice bf_emma, Apache License 2.0; run locally via kokoro-onnx (MIT) through the
  library's core/tts/tts.py. Speech check: faster-whisper small.en (MIT; OpenAI Whisper weights, MIT).

MUSIC & SOUND
- Original score and sound design, written for this film in mix.py: synthesis in numpy (pulse bass, FM telemetry
  plucks and pings, filtered-noise beds and sweeps, synthesized wind, water, ship horn, ratchet) plus sampled
  instruments played through the library's core/audio/sampler.py:
  timpani, concert bass drum, gran cassa, tam-tam (reversed), gong, suspended cymbal (bowed, stick, crescendo,
  reversed hit), clash cymbals, closed hi-hat, vibraphone, bowed vibraphone, glass harp, French horn (sustain and
  staccato), trombone (sustain and staccato), tuba (sustain and staccato).
- Samples (CC0): FreePats project (freepats.zenvoid.org), VS Chamber Orchestra: Community Edition (Versilian
  Studios), Versilian Community Sample Library (Versilian Studios).
- Procedural helpers (click, whoosh, creak, compress, limit) from the library's core/audio/sfx.py.
